  "content": {
    "type": "spr",
    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals x cubed plus 15\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></math>. What is the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>?</p>",
    "keys": [
      "23"
    ],
    "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"23\"><mn>23</mn>\n</math>. The value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math> is the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 2\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals x cubed plus 15\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in this equation yields&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals 2 cubed plus 15\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></math>. This equation can be rewritten as&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals 8 plus 15\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></math>, or&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals 23\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn></math>. Therefore, the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"23\"><mn>23</mn>\n</math>.</p>",
